<script setup lang="ts">import{computed}from'vue';import MathFormula from'../../../components/MathFormula.vue';import type{RectangularPlateResult}from'../../../core/plate-shell';import{formatEngineeringValue}from'../../../core/numeric';import{convertFromSI,getPresetUnit,getUnitDefinition,type UnitPresetId}from'../../../core/units';const p=defineProps<{result:RectangularPlateResult;unitPreset:UnitPresetId}>(),u=computed(()=>({l:getPresetUnit('length',p.unitPreset),s:getPresetUnit('stress',p.unitPreset),m:getPresetUnit('momentPerLength',p.unitPreset),f:getPresetUnit('force',p.unitPreset)}));const cv=(v:number,q:'length'|'stress'|'momentPerLength'|'force',k:keyof typeof u.value)=>formatEngineeringValue(convertFromSI(v,q,u.value[k]));const sy=(q:'length'|'stress'|'momentPerLength'|'force',k:keyof typeof u.value)=>getUnitDefinition(q,u.value[k]).symbol</script><template><section class="results" data-testid="rectangular-plate-results"><header><h3>矩形板关键点结果</h3><span :class="result.solutionNature">{{result.solutionNature==='series'?'Navier 级数解':'里茨近似'}}</span></header><div v-for="w in result.warnings" :key="w" class="warning">{{w}}</div><div class="meta"><b>公式 {{result.formulaId}}</b><span>{{result.convergence.label}}：{{result.convergence.orderOrMaxOdd}}</span><span>相邻变化：{{result.convergence.relativeChange.toExponential(3)}}</span><span>总反力：{{cv(result.totalReactionN,'force','f')}} {{sy('force','f')}}</span></div><div class="points"><article v-for="pt in [result.center,result.evaluation]" :key="`${pt.xM}-${pt.yM}`"><h4>{{pt===result.center?'中心/最大':'求值位置'}} ({{cv(pt.xM,'length','l')}}, {{cv(pt.yM,'length','l')}}) {{sy('length','l')}}</h4><p>w：<b>{{cv(pt.deflectionM,'length','l')}} {{sy('length','l')}}</b></p><p>Mx / My / Mxy：<b>{{cv(pt.momentXN,'momentPerLength','m')}} / {{cv(pt.momentYN,'momentPerLength','m')}} / {{cv(pt.twistingMomentN,'momentPerLength','m')}} {{sy('momentPerLength','m')}}</b></p><p>正面 σx / σy / τxy：<b>{{cv(pt.positiveStressXPa,'stress','s')}} / {{cv(pt.positiveStressYPa,'stress','s')}} / {{cv(pt.positiveShearPa,'stress','s')}} {{sy('stress','s')}}</b></p></article></div><details open><summary>公式与范围</summary><MathFormula :formula="result.solutionNature==='series'?'w=\\sum W_{mn}\\sin(m\\pi X/a)\\sin(n\\pi Y/b)':'w=\\sum c_{ij}(1-\\xi^2)^2\\xi^{2i}(1-\\eta^2)^2\\eta^{2j}'"/><p>仅均布载荷；RP-06 单正弦载荷后置。里茨结果不是精确解或严格误差界。</p></details></section></template><style scoped>.results{padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--color-line);border-radius:var(--radius-large);background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-panel)}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}h3,h4{margin:0}header span{padding:6px 9px;border-radius:99px;background:#e7f5ec;font-size:11px}.ritz-approximation{color:#76551e!important;background:#fff7df!important}.warning{margin-top:10px;padding:10px;background:#fff8e9}.meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:14px;font-size:11px}.points{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.points article{padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--color-line);border-radius:9px}.points p{font-size:11px}details{margin-top:14px;font-size:11px}@media(max-width:700px){.meta,.points{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
